From: SvangenStudios <svangenstudios@outlook.com>
Subject: server: a JSON answer stays JSON beside offered tools

response_format (json_object, json_schema), guided_json and structured_outputs' json constrain the reply to JSON. When
the same request also offered tools (agent clients always send theirs), the finished JSON still went through the
tool-call path: a schema answer shaped like {"name": ..., "arguments": ...} came back as tool_calls with its content
removed, and the streamed path hid or held back text that only quotes tool-call markers. chat.prepare now picks the
reply's channel from the built request.structure; on the JSON channel the output side treats the answer as data. The
tools stay in the prompt, so prompts are unchanged. tool_choice required (a structural tag), guided_regex, guided_choice
and ordinary replies keep their path.

Adapted to this engine by Mia's AI Lab from SvangenStudios' 0042 on
https://github.com/MiaAI-Lab/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017-4x-DGX-Sparks-TensorFold (PR #31); the test is new.

